\code{\link[=freqs_from_vcf]{freqs_from_vcf()}}: define the ancestral allele frequencies;
\item \code{\link[=plot.lag_power]{plot.lag_power()}}: plot power and FST against time;
\item \code{\link[=launch_app]{launch_app()}}: start the point-and-click (Shiny) interface.
